436
00:16:29,963 --> 00:16:32,092
The fire, the base and the ghost

437
00:16:32,092 --> 00:16:34,421
are the origin story of that climb.

438
00:16:34,771 --> 00:16:37,067
There are three tellers of this story

439
00:16:37,067 --> 00:16:37,997
in our sources,

440
00:16:37,997 --> 00:16:40,355
and each stresses something different.

441
00:16:40,535 --> 00:16:43,493
Wikipedia gives the dates and the bare

442
00:16:43,493 --> 00:16:43,960
