446
00:16:52,732 --> 00:16:55,778
Reading them together gives a fuller picture,

447
00:16:55,778 --> 00:16:58,351
and also shows where each leaves gaps.

448
00:16:58,701 --> 00:16:59,975
Where they agree:

449
00:16:59,975 --> 00:17:02,974
a fire damaged or destroyed the original

450
00:17:02,974 --> 00:17:05,748
