452
00:17:06,947 --> 00:17:08,372
adopting the ghost.

453
00:17:08,552 --> 00:17:09,691
Where they differ:

454
00:17:09,691 --> 00:17:11,716
the position of the ghost on the

455
00:17:11,716 --> 00:17:13,868
car, the level of detail about the

456
00:17:13,868 --> 00:17:16,780
