458
00:17:17,846 --> 00:17:19,854
None of them gives the cost of

459
00:17:19,854 --> 00:17:21,259
the fire or the move.

460
00:17:21,609 --> 00:17:23,780
The dating of the sources matters.

461
00:17:23,960 --> 00:17:27,489
The Wikipedia pages are current encyclopedia entries,

462
00:17:27,489 --> 00:17:30,753
with dated entries through twenty twenty-four and

463
00:17:30,753 --> 00:17:33,550
a twenty twenty-six mention of the lineup.

464
00:17:33,730 --> 00:17:36,961
SlashGear's article is not dated in our

465
00:17:36,961 --> 00:17:37,375
