466
00:17:37,555 --> 00:17:40,820
Jalopnik's tour is undated and refers to

467
00:17:40,820 --> 00:17:42,780
cars from the Agera era.

468
00:17:42,960 --> 00:17:45,960
So the freshest facts about the factory

469
00:17:45,960 --> 00:17:48,114
come from Wikipedia and AOL.

470
00:17:48,465 --> 00:17:51,473
One practical point for anyone planning a

471
00:17:51,473 --> 00:17:51,913
