477
00:18:03,456 --> 00:18:04,208
conditions.

478
00:18:04,388 --> 00:18:05,870
If you want to visit,

479
00:18:05,870 --> 00:18:08,057
check Koenigsegg's own website.

480
00:18:08,237 --> 00:18:10,875
We have not verified any current visiting

481
00:18:10,875 --> 00:18:11,325
policy.

482
00:18:11,675 --> 00:18:12,902
By our arithmetic,

483
00:18:12,902 --> 00:18:15,767
the whole arc spans sixty-three years from

484
00:18:15,767 --> 00:18:19,177
the squadron's founding in November nineteen forty

485
00:18:19,177 --> 00:18:21,495
to the carmaker's move in late two

486
00:18:21,495 --> 00:18:22,518
thousand three.

487
00:18:22,698 --> 00:18:26,039
Eighty-six years separate the squadron's founding from

488
00:18:26,039 --> 00:18:26,657
this year.

489
00:18:26,837 --> 00:18:27,788
In that time,

490
00:18:27,788 --> 00:18:30,056
the same site has gone from jet

491
00:18:30,056 --> 00:18:32,616
fighters to carbon-fibre hypercars,

492
00:18:32,616 --> 00:18:35,103
which is why the story keeps being

493
00:18:35,103 --> 00:18:35,615
retold.

494
00:18:35,965 --> 00:18:37,819
The lesson, if there is one,

495
00:18:37,819 --> 00:18:40,203
is that companies are shaped by what

496
00:18:40,203 --> 00:18:42,123
